  "E5" [label="(1,0,0) Spinons are well-established quasiparticles in one-dimensional (1D) systems , , but their presence in dimensions higher than one remains a contentious topic ,."];
  "E6" [label="(4,0,0) Indeed, the broad continua observed across many copper-based square-lattice AFs , , , known as the ‘(π, 0) anomaly’, have been attributed to spinon excitations."];
